creatures:
- name: Bone Devil
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 16  
      **Hit Points** 161 (rollable(dice=17d10 + 68,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Fly 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Initiative) (17)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Deception Check), Insight rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Insight Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** cold  
      **Damage Immunities** fire, poison  
      **Condition Immunities** poisoned  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft. (unimpeded by magical ***Darkness***), Passive Perception 12  
      **Languages** Infernal; telepathy 120 ft.  
      **Challenge** 9 (5,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Traits

      ***Diabolical Restoration.*** If the devil dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its ***Hit Points*** somewhere in the Nine Hells.

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The devil has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The devil makes two Claw attacks and one Infernal Sting attack.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage.

      ***Infernal Sting.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=To Hit [Infernal Sting]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+4,dicelabel=Damage [Infernal Sting]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=4d8,dicelabel=Damage [Infernal Sting]) Poison damage, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the start of the devil's next turn. While ***Poisoned***, the target can't regain ***Hit Points***.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Fiend (Devil), Lawful Evil*  
    **Challenge** 9
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024bonedevil
  status: 1

